<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="ah36-0000-a000-b000" name="Alien Hives (Testing v3.6.0)" revision="1" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="b174-c09d-3660-f001" gameSystemRevision="3"><sharedRules><rule id="ah36-rule-0" name="Fear(X)" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-1" name="Hero" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-2" name="Hive Bond" hidden="false"><description>If most models in this unit have this rule, they get +1 to Morale Test rolls when shot/charged from over 9&quot;/6&quot; away.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-3" name="AP(X)" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-4" name="Scout" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-5" name="Strider" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-6" name="Assault" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-7" name="Bane" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-8" name="Spell Resistance" hidden="false"><description>Against spell wounds, ignore on 2+; against other wounds, ignore on 6+.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-9" name="Unstoppable" hidden="false"><description>This weapon ignores Regeneration and ignores negative modifiers not from this model's special rules.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-10" name="No Retreat" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-11" name="Self-Destruct(X)" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-12" name="Slow" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-13" name="Relentless" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-14" name="Blast(X)" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-15" name="Indirect" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-16" name="Ambush" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-17" name="Regeneration" hidden="false"><description>Use OPR Grimdark Future 3.6.0 regeneration rule.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-18" name="Caster Group" hidden="false"><description>Pick one model with this rule in this unit to have Caster(X), where X is the total number of models with this rule in this unit.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-19" name="Stealth" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-20" name="Flying" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-21" name="Transport(X)" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-22" name="Reliable" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-23" name="Caster(X)" hidden="false"><description>Follow OPR Grimdark Future 3.6.0 casting rules.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-24" name="Infiltrate" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-25" name="Spawn(Shooter Grunts [5])" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-26" name="Rending" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-27" name="Fragment" hidden="false"><description>When attacking units where most models have Defense 4+ to 6+, the target re-rolls successful unmodified defense results of 4-6.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-28" name="Artillery" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-29" name="Cumbersome" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-30" name="Spawn(Spores [5])" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-31" name="Ravage(X)" hidden="false"><description>Once per round, when it is this model's turn to strike in melee, roll X dice before attacking unless this unit is Fatigued. For each 6+ the target takes one wound.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-32" name="Aircraft" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-33" name="Retaliate(X)" hidden="false"><description>When this model takes wounds in melee, the attacker takes X hits per wound taken.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-34" name="Unique Hero" hidden="false"><description>Counts as having Hero, and this model may only be taken once per army.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-35" name="Surge" hidden="false"><description>Use the Alien Hives v3.6.0 Surge weapon rule.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-36" name="Fast" hidden="false"><description>Refer to the OPR Grimdark Future / Alien Hives v3.6.0 special rule of this name.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-37" name="Furious Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Furious.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-38" name="Predator" hidden="false"><description>For each unmodified hit roll of 6, make one extra attack; extra attacks cannot generate more attacks.</description></rule><rule id="ah36-rule-39" name="Precision Debuff" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation before attacking, pick one enemy unit within 18&quot; in line of sight; it gets -1 to hit once (next time it applies).</description></rule></sharedRules><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="ah36-0-unit" name="Hive Lord" type="unit" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="ah36-0-category" name="category" targetId="b174-c09d-3660-f041" primary="true"/></categoryLinks><profiles><profile id="ah36-0-profile" name="Hive Lord" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f010" typeName="Unit" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic name="Quality" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f011">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Defense" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f012">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f013">Fear(2), Hero, Hive Bond, Tough(12)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><infoLinks><infoLink id="ah36-0-innate-0" name="Fear(X)" h